# INTERRUPTED PRESS: VolumeUp is pressed (its step is already emitted), then Power arrives
# before the hold class can fire, so the press becomes a chord and NO phantom volume-panel
# action appears. The chord is then cancelled, and the short power press still counts as the
# A32 short press (defer_power_short_for_double is 0 by design).
0 key volume_up 1
200 key power 1
300 key volume_up 0
400 key power 0
